.TH "CRUFT" "1" "September 2026" "cruft" "cruft User Manual"
.SH NAME
.PP
cruft \- Calculinux reduced footprint framebuffer terminal
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
.B cruft
.RB [ command ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
.B cruft
is a Linux framebuffer terminal emulator derived from yaft, tuned for
low memory on Calculinux devices.
.SH CUSTOMIZATION
.PP
Rewrite conf.h before make.
.SH ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES
.TP
.B FRAMEBUFFER
Specify framebuffer device (default /dev/fb0).
.TP
.B CRUFT_FONT
Path to a CRUFTFN1 font blob (default /usr/share/cruft/console.cruftfont).
.TP
.B CRUFT
If this variable includes "wall", cruft enables wallpaper mode and a
framebuffer shadow buffer. See cruft_wall.
.SH AUTHOR
.PP
Calculinux fork; upstream yaft by haru <uobikiemukot at gmail dot com>
